# Portrait Prompt Engineering (User's Style)

## Core Principles

### 1. Five-Layer Fixed Structure (weight front→back, each layer independent, no overlap)

| Layer | Name | Weight | What it controls |
|:-----|:-----|:-------|:----------------|
| 1 | 主体基础层 | Highest | Face, age, ethnicity,五官, hair, base temperament |
| 2 | 肤质妆容层 | 2nd | Skin texture, pores, oil, fine lines — positive only, no negatives |
| 3 | 体态情绪穿搭层 | 3rd | Pose, expression, clothing, accessories, body |
| 4 | 镜头光影构图层 | 4th | Camera angle, focal length, light direction, depth of field |
| 5 | 场景氛围画质层 | Lowest | Environment, color tone, film grain, aspect ratio |

**Negative Prompt** — standalone module, collects ALL forbidden elements. Positive prompt should NEVER contain negative statements.

### 2. Writing Style (Mandatory)

- **Natural paragraph flow** — not comma-separated keyword lists
- **Semicolons and periods** to organize logical groups
- **Concrete, executable descriptions only** — AI cannot understand abstract concepts like "邻家感", "温柔气质", "真实感", "自然不极致精致"
- **Negative uses "无" sentence pattern** — e.g. "无塑料假皮肤，无重度磨皮"
- **Be specific about what you WANT**, not just what you don't want

### 3. Abstract words to NEVER use (AI cannot execute)

| Don't write | Instead write | Reason |
|:-----------|:-------------|:-------|
| 邻家气质 | 校园风格，非网红精致路线 | AI无法理解「邻家」 |
| 五官自然不极致精致 | 五官比例标准/普通 | AI无法量化「不极致」 |
| 温柔/优美/柔和 | 直接描述具体特征，或省略 | 主观形容词无效 |
| 真实感/质感 | 写具体特征：毛孔、油光、细纹 | 太宽泛 |
| 生活化 | 日常自然光线下的XX环境 | 抽象 |
| 像身边认识的女孩 | ❌ 直接删 | AI无法理解 |
| 身材曲线柔和流畅 | 腰臀比例自然，曲线不过分夸张 | 抽象 |
| 松弛温柔浅笑 | 松弛浅笑 | 删「温柔」 |

### 4. Known Model Bias — Text Alone Can't Fix

When the following fails despite correct prompts, the model's training data bias is stronger than text. Switch to image-to-image with a reference photo.

| Issue | Model | Strategy |
|:------|:------|:---------|
| ❌ 唇色偏亮粉/荧光 | Seedream 4.5 | 正向写「自然淡玫瑰粉色，阴影不偏紫不发灰」+ 负向「无唇色过艳无荧光唇色」。拉不动就垫图生图 |
| ❌ 全身像俯拍 | Seedream 4.5 | 需要在L1+L4+负向**三层同时**约束。只在某一层写无效 |
| ❌ 生成标准美女脸 | 所有模型 | 文生图天花板。要稳定输出特定长相→必须图生图垫参考照 |

### 5. Five-Layer Template (User's Definitive Version — 2026-07-21)

Copy and fill per layer. Concatenate as LAYER1 + LAYER2 + LAYER3 + LAYER4 + LAYER5 with periods or newlines between.

```
