## Pitfalls

- AI cannot understand abstract words — test every adjective against "can a machine execute this?"
- Five-layer weight is real — don't put critical instructions in LAYER5 and expect them to work
- Negative prompt MUST use "无" format, not "不要" or "禁止"
- Eye-level angle needs reinforcement in BOTH LAYER1 and LAYER4 — one layer alone is not enough for Seedream
- **Full-body vs Half-body switch:** when changing from full-body to half-body (e.g. user says "脸太小了"), delete ALL of: 身高 from LAYER1, 下半身裙+鞋子 from LAYER3. Change LAYER4 from 全身版 to 半身版. Keep LAYER2 unchanged.
- If a constraint (like "no 俯拍") keeps failing despite being in the prompt, the model's training data bias is stronger than the text — switch to image-to-image with a reference photo
- **NEVER swap reference images without asking the user.** Different reference images produce different people. If a图生图 fails, report the failure and ask which image to use — don't pick another one yourself.

### 7. 图生图 Reference Image Rules

**Workflow:**
1. Upload image to ARK: `POST /api/v3/files` with `purpose=user_data` → get `file-xxx` ID
2. Pass ID to `image_list` parameter in Seedream API call
3. Only 1 reference image per call — multiple images confuse the model

**Known Seedream 4.5 图生图 Limitations (confirmed across 4+ attempts):**

| What it CAN lock | What it CANNOT lock |
|:----------------|:--------------------|
| Gender ✅ | Specific hairstyle (卷→直) ❌ |
| General ethnicity ✅ | Exact facial features (神似但不同) ❌ |
| Body type (tall/slim) ✅ | Clothing texture & patterns ❌ |
| Outfit type (dress/skirt/shoes) ✅ | Hair color nuance ❌ |
| | Age precision ❌ |

**Diagnosis path when output doesn't match reference:**
1. First check: did the model get gender wrong? → Try stronger gender constraint in prompt
2. Second: ethnicity/race mismatch? → Add explicit "东亚" to prompt
3. Third: facial features drifted? → This is model limitation. Use different tool (not Seedream) for character-consistent outputs

**NEVER do:** silently swap to a different reference image when the first attempt fails. Always tell the user what happened and ask which image to use next.

### 8. API vs App Discrepancy (Seedream 4.5)

ARK API (what I use) vs 豆包App (what the user uses) are NOT the same:

| Feature | ARK API | 豆包App |
|:--------|:--------|:--------|
| Face protection/lock | ❌ None | ✅ Built-in |
| reference_strength | ❌ Not supported | ✅ Available |
| cfg_scale | ❌ Not supported | ✅ Available |
| style_type (photorealism) | ❌ Not supported | ✅ Available |
| Sampling steps | ❌ Not supported | ✅ Available |
| Creative enhancement toggle | ❌ Not supported | ✅ Available |
| Result quality (same prompt) | ⭐⭐ | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ |

**Conclusion:** For character-consistent outputs (三视图/四视图/角色设定稿), tell the user to use 豆包App with the prompt. API裸调 cannot match App quality for face-locked generation.

**ARK API supported parameters only:**
`model`, `prompt`, `negative_prompt`, `image_list`, `size` (format: `WIDTHxHEIGHT` like `2560x1440`, NOT colon-separated), `n`, `watermark`

### 9. 图生图 API Call Checklist (always include ALL of these)

```
☐ Upload ref image → get file-xxx ID (POST /api/v3/files, purpose=user_data)
☐ Build JSON payload with ALL fields:
   - model
   - prompt
   - negative_prompt (ALWAYS include — user got angry when I forgot this)
   - image_list: [file-xxx]
   - size
   - n: 1
   - watermark: false
☐ Call POST /api/v3/images/generations
☐ Download result with curl
☐ Run vision_analyze to VERIFY the output before showing to user
```

